# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a mirror circuit of a Trotterized time evolution of a 1D Ising chain Hamiltonian on eight qubits. Mirror the circuit to cancel its unitary and form an identity circuit, so each observable's ideal expectation value is known to be 1 without the need to compute it. In addition, mirroring doubles the circuit depth, which in turn doubles the noise's effect.\n"
msgstr "Prepara un circuito espejo de una evolución temporal con Trotter del hamiltoniano de una cadena de Ising 1D en ocho qubits. Refleja el circuito para cancelar su unitaria y formar un circuito identidad, de modo que el valor esperado ideal de cada observable sea 1 sin necesidad de calcularlo. Además, el espejado duplica la profundidad del circuito, lo que a su vez duplica el efecto del ruido.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the angle $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ to make the dynamics non-Clifford.\n"
msgstr "Usa el ángulo $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ para que la dinámica no sea de Clifford.\n"

